          "quote": "体温≥38.5℃"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 is met. The doctor acted on the high-risk wound and glucose presentation by directing urgent ED assessment, then provided ED deterioration triggers including fever/chills, worsening drainage/odor/bleeding, altered consciousness/respiratory distress, and glucose/ketone evaluation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1",
