          "quote": "必须尽快线下评估"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 is met. The doctor recognized bone cement detachment plus more than one month of poor diabetic-foot wound healing as requiring prompt in-person surgical/wound evaluation rather than simple observation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
