          "explanation": "The doctor reinforced that the family should not independently administer home diabetes medications during ED care.",
          "quote": "家里不要再自行给任何降糖药"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 is met. The doctor considered poor intake, very high glucose, ketone and renal-function uncertainty, hypoglycemia symptoms, and onsite monitoring, while setting safe boundaries against self-directed insulin or metformin changes.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
