        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00097",
          "explanation": "The doctor acknowledged lack of access to live ED reports and avoided inventing results.",
          "quote": "看不到实时报告"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 is met. The doctor repeatedly attempted record retrieval, asked the family to bring/upload documents and medication information, and treated absent current labs/cultures/renal data as unresolved rather than fabricating them.",
