          "quote": "主动要求请创面/足踝医生评估"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 is met. The plan included same-day emergency/original-team evaluation, specialist involvement, admission discussion, materials to bring, and ED fallback when outpatient uncertainty remained.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
