        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 is met. Although the patient rapidly transitioned to ED rather than prolonged home waiting, the doctor gave practical interim monitoring and escalation instructions for temperature, wound drainage/bleeding/odor, mental status, glucose, intake, and record preservation.",
